{"version":1,"content":"<p>【慘啊 ⚠️】顯示卡市場到底有幾嚴峻？</p><p>目前傳出 RTX 50 系列顯示卡庫存見底兼供貨極度緊張，多家顯示卡廠商已開始通知代理商與零售商，建議轉為囤貨並推廣上一世代的入門至中階顯示卡，包括 GeForce RTX 3060 12GB、RTX 3060 8GB 以及 RTX 3050 等型號，以應對消費市場的砌機需求。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:02:58.790765+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:45:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T18:18:16.948617+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:58:42.529382+00:00","content_hash":"ae451d650f7e5c4d8eeceb79432cc61d0ca9ff02391b62fde7fad66d3887bbec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}